4551: Page 110 | Recd 235 PM
New York Apl 20
New York 20th 4th Month For Capt Fox
full names are David Heustis Samuel
M Simpson Richard D Barlon James
Hunter Chas T Kilsey William Atkinson
the latter has gone to New Orleans
for his health for thirty days
the others are all here and
they should all be arrested now 
for Stover has a heavy amount
of triplicates ready to pass &
the Exercise of the wholesome discipline
will save much money  Send
the order to the Commandant through
me and I will see to
the siezure of those Books &
papers that Wilson requires signed H
S - Ol cott special Commissioner &c


Recd 4 PM
Fort Monroe Apl 20th 1864 2 pm
For Gen Grant Culpeper - Instructions in regard to 
Exchange of prisoners received and will be implicitly
followed - I assume how ever that they
are not intended to interfere with the special
exchanges of sick and wounded prisoners on one
side and the other now going on Gen Butler

